            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "Bouncing Duck Simulator allows you to fulfill your wildest dreams. Bouncing a rubber duck around, bouncing a pink rubber duck around, bouncing... more ducks? Don't be shy, you gotta bounce them all!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game features:<br />\r\n- A room made of 6 walls, allowing for crazy bouncing action!<br />\r\n- Three differents endings and hidden techniques/achievements, for a great replayability!<br />\r\n- A wide range of collectable ducks that you have to find to complete the Duckedex to 100%!<br />\r\n- Many duck combinations and non-linear gameplay, every playthrough is unique!<br />\r\n- Various duck sounds that will haunt you for days (months), even during your sleep!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBounce your way to the ultimate title of Master Bouncer!",
